12
00:00:46,397 --> 00:00:49,417
Kenali dahulu format Sejarah Kertas 2.

13
00:00:49,417 --> 00:00:54,663
Ia ada dua bahagian, seratus markah, dan dua jam tiga puluh minit.

14
00:00:54,963 --> 00:00:58,719
Bahagian A, soalan struktur: empat soalan, semuanya wajib

15
00:00:58,719 --> 00:01:01,091
